<p>Abbas (asws) Mar Gaya Hai, Main Lut Gaya Zainab S.A.</p>

<p>Tooti Hai Kamar Meri, Ankho'n Mein Andhera Hai, Main Lut Gaya Zainab S.A.</p>

<p>
1. Baba Ne Duao'n Mein Jis Laal Ko Maanga Tha.</p>

<p>Amma Ne Jise Meri Nusrat Ke Liye Bheja.</p>

<p>Woh Qoon Mein Hai G'hlta'n, Reti Pa Tadapta Hai, Main Lut Gaya Zainab S.A.</p>

<p>
2. Katwaye Hue Bazu Sota Hai Wo Darya Par.</p>

<p>Parde Ki Hifazat Ab Wo Kaise Kare Qwaahar.</p>

<p>Yeh Baat Rulaati Hai, Dil Mera Larazta Hai, Main Lut Gaya Zainab S.A.</p>

<p>
3. Ek Gurza Laga Aisa Sar Par Mere Bhayi Ke.</p>

<p>Na Hath Salaamat the Us Dam Mere Bhayi Ke.</p>

<p>Sar Ke Bal Ghode Se, Wo Qaak Pe Aaya Hai, Main Lut Gaya Zainab S.A.</p>

<p>
4. Paamal Hua Laasha Is Tarha Se Ghazi (asws) Ka.</p>

<p>Qasim (asws) Ki Tarha Maine Tukdo'n Mein Ise Paaya.</p>

<p>Ek Simt Mile Baazu, Ek Simt Mein Aaza Hai, Main Lut Gaya Zainab S.A.</p>

<p>5. Bhayi Ki Wasiyat Hai Hargiz Na Use Kehna.</p>

<p>Aaqa Mere Laashe Ko Qaime Mein Na Le Jaana.</p>

<p>Na Dekh Sakegi Eo, Masoom Sakina S.A. Hai, Main Lut Gaya Zainab S.A.</p>

<p>
Abbas (asws) Mar Gaya Hai, Main Lut Gaya Zainab S.A.</p>

